{
  "sn12.50:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 12.50 ",
  "sn12.50:0.2": "5. Gahapativagga ",
  "sn12.50:0.3": "Dutiyaariyasāvakasutta ",
  "sn12.50:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ viharati. ",
  "sn12.50:1.2": "“Na, bhikkhave, sutavato ariyasāvakassa evaṁ hoti: ",
  "sn12.50:1.3": "‘kiṁ nu kho kismiṁ sati kiṁ hoti, kissuppādā kiṁ uppajjati? ",
  "sn12.50:1.4": "Kismiṁ sati saṅkhārā honti, kismiṁ sati viññāṇaṁ hoti, kismiṁ sati nāmarūpaṁ hoti, kismiṁ sati saḷāyatanaṁ hoti, kismiṁ sati phasso hoti, kismiṁ sati vedanā hoti, kismiṁ sati taṇhā hoti, kismiṁ sati upādānaṁ hoti, kismiṁ sati bhavo hoti, kismiṁ sati jāti hoti, kismiṁ sati jarāmaraṇaṁ hotī’ti? ",
  "sn12.50:2.1": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, sutavato ariyasāvakassa aparappaccayā ñāṇamevettha hoti: ",
  "sn12.50:2.2": "‘imasmiṁ sati idaṁ hoti, imassuppādā idaṁ uppajjati. ",
  "sn12.50:2.3": "Avijjāya sati saṅkhārā honti; ",
  "sn12.50:2.4": "saṅkhāresu sati viññāṇaṁ hoti; ",
  "sn12.50:2.5": "viññāṇe sati nāmarūpaṁ hoti; ",
  "sn12.50:2.6": "nāmarūpe sati saḷāyatanaṁ hoti; ",
  "sn12.50:2.7": "saḷāyatane sati phasso hoti; ",
  "sn12.50:2.8": "phasse sati vedanā hoti; ",
  "sn12.50:2.9": "vedanāya sati taṇhā hoti; ",
  "sn12.50:2.10": "taṇhāya sati upādānaṁ hoti; ",
  "sn12.50:2.11": "upādāne sati bhavo hoti; ",
  "sn12.50:2.12": "bhave sati jāti hoti; ",
  "sn12.50:2.13": "jātiyā sati jarāmaraṇaṁ hotī’ti. ",
  "sn12.50:2.14": "So 